    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey can u explain what exactly the seller is responsible for under CIF Incoterms 2020? i'm looking at a contract for electronic components moving from korea to germany and need to be sure about the insurance and freight handover points.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Under CIF Incoterms 2020, the seller's responsibility extends to delivering the goods, cleared for export, to the named port of destination in Korea. Crucially, the seller must also contract for and pay for both the main carriage (freight) and adequate marine insurance up to the destination port in Germany. Risk transfers to the buyer once the goods are loaded onboard the vessel in Korea, even though the seller arranges and pays for the delivery costs to Germany.",
