    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. so if the risk transfers to us (the buyer) once they're loaded on the ship in korea, but they're still paying for the freight and insurance, does that mean we have any say in how the shipment is handled or who the actual carrier is, or is it totally up to them? i just want to make sure we aren't stuck with a bad carrier while they hold the reins.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
